    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bg": "00054",
    "bgm": "041",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ありがとう\r\n悪いな……資料を届けに来ただけなのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ううん、わざわざ来てくれたんだもん\r\n玄関で済ますなんてできないよー",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あっ、でも忙しいなら、\r\n本当に無理しなくていいからね……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、今日は大丈夫だ\r\nじゃあ……ありがたくいただくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "どうぞ！　召し上がれー\r\n美味しく淹れられてるかな？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………ああ、美味しい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "よかったぁ☆　えへへっ……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "なんかプロデューサーさんが、\r\nうちにいるのって不思議な感じだね",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……嬉しいかも☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "──あっ、そうだ！\r\nプロデューサーさんに見せたい写真があったの！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "小さい頃の甜花ちゃんと甘奈が、\r\nお遊戯会でね、一緒に歌って踊った時の……ほらこれ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、ふたりとも可愛い服を着て……\r\nはは、この時からアイドルみたいだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でしょ！　やっぱりそう思うでしょー！\r\nだから、見せたいなって思ってたんだ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "──この小さかった甘奈を、\r\n本物のアイドルにしてくれたのはプロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈ね、アイドルになってよかったって……\r\n心の底から思ってる。──だから本当にありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへっ……この時に比べたら、\r\n今の甘奈、ちょっとは成長できたかな……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002010140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あっ、でも変わってないとこもあるかも\r\n癖とか、苦手な食べ物とか……あと──",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400201/1014002010140"
  },
  {
